                  "explanation": "Sustained OSKM expression turns adult cells into pluripotent stem cells, which form teratomas (mixed-tissue tumors) when injected back. Partial reprogramming (brief, pulsed, or OSK without c-MYC) is being explored to capture the rejuvenation benefit without the cancer risk.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Quiz: OSKM Risk</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Why partial, not full</text><rect x='100' y='200' width='900' height='280' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='250' fill='#ef4444' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>The Teratoma Risk</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Continuous OSKM removes cell identity</text><text x='150' y='355' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Cell becomes pluripotent</text><text x='150' y='400' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>In a body: forms teratoma (mixed-tissue tumor)</text><text x='150' y='445' fill='#888' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Demonstrated in many mouse studies</text><rect x='100' y='520' width='900' height='220' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='565' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Partial Solutions</text><text x='150' y='615' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Pulsed dosing (Ocampo et al. 2016)</text><text x='150' y='650' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Drop c-MYC (Sinclair OSK)</text><text x='150' y='685' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Tissue-specific AAV delivery</text><rect x='100' y='770' width='900' height='170' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='820' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Open Question</text><text x='550' y='870' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>How brief / how partial is enough?</text><text x='550' y='905' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Active area of research.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Identity preservation is the central challenge."
                  }
